## 4. C# / .NET

### 4.1. Blockerande med `Thread.Sleep`
```csharp
for (int i = 0; i < 10; i++) {
    Console.WriteLine($"Iteration {i}");
    Thread.Sleep(500); // 500 ms
}
```

### 4.2. Asynkront med `await Task.Delay`
```csharp
using System;
using System.Threading.Tasks;

class Program {
    static async Task Main() {
        for (int i = 0; i < 10; i++) {
            Console.WriteLine($"Iteration {i}");
            await Task.Delay(500); // 500 ms utan att blockera tråden
        }
    }
}
```

### 4.3. UI‑exempel (WinForms/WPF) med `DispatcherTimer`
```csharp
DispatcherTimer timer = new DispatcherTimer { Interval = TimeSpan.FromMilliseconds(500) };
int i = 0;
timer.Tick += (s, e) => {
    if (i >= 10) { timer.Stop(); return; }
    Console.WriteLine($"Iteration {i}");
    i++;
};
timer.Start();
```

